# Storybook (`*.stories.tsx` in `@repo/ui`)

## Colocation

- Stories live **next to** the component they exercise. **Footer / connect** organisms belong under **`Organisms/Footer/`** (or equivalent), **not** under `Templates/HomePage/`, even if the footer is used on every page.

## Canvas copy

- Prefer **neutral / placeholder** text for structural stories so the canvas reads as **layout**, not production marketing copy. Real copy stays in defaults modules or apps.

- Drop **edge-case** stories (e.g. single-item grid stress tests) unless they guard real layout bugs.

## Names

- Story **export** names use **PascalCase** (e.g. `Default`, `WithAccent`, `ProjectShowcase`) — same convention as components. **Display** names (`name: '…'` on a story) use **sentence case** for human-readable labels only.

- Avoid user-facing **“grid”** in story titles when the product name should be **Projects** / **Blog** (not “Project grid”).

- Do **not** set `title` on story `meta` for sidebar placement — see **`storybook.mdc`** (`titlePrefix` in `main.ts` for **Tokens** / **Framework** roots; filesystem below that).
